# OpenCart Manual Testing Project

## Project Overview

This project documents manual testing activities performed on the OpenCart e-commerce application.

## Testing Scope

- User registration
- User login and logout
- Product search
- Product details
- Shopping cart
- Checkout process

## Testing Activities

- Understanding requirements
- Preparing test scenarios
- Writing test cases
- Positive and negative testing
- Test execution
- Defect identification and reporting

